WEBVTT

00:01:26.596 --> 00:01:31.716
that's ever been done,
following people since 1938.

00:01:32.476 --> 00:01:36.036
From adolescence
all the way through old age,

00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:39.636
and now following all of their children,

00:01:39.676 --> 00:01:41.436
thousands of lives.

00:01:42.436 --> 00:01:46.116
And we began to find,

00:01:46.116 --> 00:01:48.116
about 30 years ago,

00:01:48.156 --> 00:01:53.556
this startling connection
between warm relationships

00:01:53.556 --> 00:01:56.756
and how good our lives feel to us,

00:01:56.756 --> 00:01:57.996
our well-being,

00:01:58.036 --> 00:02:04.196
and also the fact that warm relationships
seemed to keep people